---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
import { withBase } from "../utils/url";
import { LINKS } from "../consts";
import "../styles/pages/landing.css";
---

<Page title="Marc Recio · Data scientist who builds AI systems" description="Marc Recio, data scientist who builds AI systems: a master's thesis where language models read genomics papers and tested code makes the calls, and a method of his own for working with AI agents." nav="landing" footer="landing">
<main id="top">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero__grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container hero__inner">
      <div class="avatar"><img src={withBase("/portrait-4x5.jpg")} alt="Portrait of Marc Recio" width="640" height="800"></div>
      <p class="greet">Hi, I'm Marc Recio.</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Data scientist who builds <span class="accent-word">AI systems</span>.</h1>
      <p class="hero__line">Plant breeder by training. I build <span style="white-space:nowrap">language-model</span> pipelines that curate the genomics literature, and keep growing in machine learning, deep learning and data&nbsp;analysis.</p>
      <div class="dock">
        <a href={LINKS.linkedin} aria-label="LinkedIn" data-label="LinkedIn"><span class="logo" style={`--m:url(${withBase("/icons/linkedin.svg")})`}></span></a>
        <a href={LINKS.github} aria-label="GitHub" data-label="GitHub"><span class="logo" style={`--m:url(${withBase("/icons/github.svg")})`}></span></a>
        <a href={`mailto:${LINKS.email}`} aria-label="Email" data-label="Email"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="3" y="5.5" width="18" height="13" rx="2.2"/><path d="M3.8 7.2l8.2 5.9 8.2-5.9"/></svg></a>
        <a class="cv" href={withBase(LINKS.cv)} aria-label="CV, PDF" data-label="CV · PDF"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4.5 2.5h15v15l-4 4h-11z"/><path d="M19.5 17.5h-4v4"/><rect x="6.5" y="4.6" width="5.2" height="6.2" rx=".6"/><circle cx="9.1" cy="7" r="1.1"/><path d="M7.5 10.2c.3-.9.9-1.4 1.6-1.4s1.3.5 1.6 1.4"/><path d="M15.84 5.86A1.75 1.75 0 1 0 15.84 8.34" stroke-width="1.55"/><path d="M16.6 5.3l1.05 3.6 1.05-3.6" stroke-width="1.55"/><path d="M6.5 13.6h11M6.5 16.2h11M6.5 18.8h7"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about glow" aria-labelledby="about-title" style="--gx:78%;--gy:40%">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <p class="label"><span class="label__n">01</span>About me</p>
          <h2 id="about-title" class="h2">Biology first, <span class="accent-word">then the data</span>.</h2>
          <p class="lede">Curiosity took me from food science to plant breeding, then to data science, where I found my vocation: data, models and AI systems. That path feeds my creativity: I often find common patterns in very different areas.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="stack reveal" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Photos: choose one to bring it to the front"><input class="stack__r" type="radio" name="ph" id="ph-0" aria-label="VDS, Valencia 2025" checked><input class="stack__r" type="radio" name="ph" id="ph-1" aria-label="Thesis defence, 2024"><label class="ph ph-0" for="ph-0"><img src={withBase("/about/vds-2025.jpg")} alt="Marc Recio at the VDS tech summit in Valencia, 2025" loading="lazy" style="object-position:50% 30%"><span class="cap">VDS, Valencia 2025</span></label><label class="ph ph-1" for="ph-1"><img src={withBase("/work/defence.jpg")} alt="Marc Recio at his plant-breeding thesis defence" loading="lazy"><span class="cap">Thesis defence, 2024</span></label></figure>
      </div>
      <div class="philosophy reveal">
        <div>
          <p class="minilabel">My philosophy</p>
          <p class="statement">Automate the repetitive, keep the&nbsp;creative.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="lede">How I take on any problem, and why I work on systems: what repeats is delegated, and my time goes where I learn and move forward.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section work" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="label"><span class="label__n">02</span>Selected work</p>
        <h2 id="work-title" class="h2">The work I would <span class="accent-word">show first</span>.</h2>
        <p class="work__sub">Each one has a full write-up.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rows">
        <article class="project p-thesis reveal" id="thesis">
          <a class="project__media" href={withBase("/work/tfm/")} aria-label="The thesis" style="--ar:1600/860"><img src={withBase("/work/thesis-pipeline.jpg")} alt="The thesis's pipeline: papers read by language models, gene identifiers checked by code, two gates held by a curator" loading="lazy"></a>
          <div>
            <p class="project__meta">01 / 2025–26 · Master's thesis</p>
            <h3 class="project__title">Human-in-the-loop <span>gene curation</span></h3>
            <p class="project__full">“A human-in-the-loop AI-driven workflow for literature curation: improving the gene reference catalogues of PlantaeViz species”</p>
            <p class="project__line">Language models read the papers, tested code makes the calls; the results wait for the paper and the defence.</p>
            <div class="project__chips"><span class="chip">In progress</span><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">Docling</span><span class="tag">LLMs</span><span class="tag">Gold-set evaluation</span></div>
            <a class="btn" href={withBase("/work/tfm/")}>Read the write-up <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="project p-method reveal">
